<title>BOSNIA: French peacekeeper kills himself in Bosnia - NATO.</title>
<headline>French peacekeeper kills himself in Bosnia - NATO.</headline>
<dateline>SARAJEVO 1997-03-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>A French soldier serving with NATO-led Stabilisation Forces in Bosnia died of self-inflicted wounds, NATO said on Saturday.</p>
<p>The soldier was found badly wounded in his guardpost in a small village near the southern town of Mostar on Friday and immediately taken to an SFOR hospital, where he died.</p>
<p>A military police inquiry found he had shot himself with his own rifle, an alliance statement said.</p>
</text>
